<title>USA: DVL Inc Q3 net profit with gain vs loss.</title>
<headline>DVL Inc Q3 net profit with gain vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA, N.J. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.41	     loss $0.15</p>
<p> Net profit	5,849	     loss 1,387</p>
<p> Oper revs	 729			732</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  14,386		   9,210</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.44	     loss $0.19</p>
<p> Net profit	6,241	     loss 1,690</p>
<p> Oper revs	 1,819		    2,455</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  14,126		   8,907</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its current third quarter results include a $0.45 per share gain on the settlement of indebtnesses. The current nine month results include a $0.58 per share gain on the settlement.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
